        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;• Condition skills are optional &amp;amp; gated on session.project.* flags.&lt;br&gt;• Safety responses are verbatim (never rephrased).&lt;br&gt;• Profile, meal logs &amp;amp; plans are persisted per user in the file store (keyed by sender id).&lt;br&gt;• Project memory holds only write-once condition flags; all mutable data lives in the file store.&lt;br&gt;• Rephraser runs on Gemini to keep Groq&#39;s token budget for the orchestrator.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
